reat of departure. Feeling helpless, I told him, 'Go then, and stay away!' Alas, where is my lord who is my support now? The space between my breasts has filled with tears and become a vast pond where black-legged white herons feed.","modern":"\"நான் போகிறேன், போகிறேன்\" என்று அவன் அடிக்கடி சொன்னதால், அது அவனுடைய வழக்கமான பொய்ப் பயணம் என்று நினைத்து, வேறு வழியின்றி, \"நீ போய் அங்கேயே தங்கிவிடு\" என்று கோபத்தில் கூறிவிட்டேன். அந்தோ! எனக்கு ஆதாரமாக விளங்கும் என் தலைவன் இப்போது எங்கே இருக்கிறானோ? என் மார்புகளுக்கு இடைப்பட்ட பகுதி கண்ணீரால் நிறைந்து, கருமையான கால்களைக் கொண்ட வெண்மையான நாரைகள் வந்து இரைய தேடும் பெரிய குளமாக மாறிவிட்டது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante in deep distress after the hero has departed. The hero had repeatedly threatened to leave, but she had always assumed it was a playful, deceptive threat to test her love. Frustrated and feeling helpless, she finally told him to go ahead and leave permanently. Now that he has actually departed, she regrets her words and wonders where her beloved support is. Her intense grief has caused her to weep so profusely that the tears pooling between her breasts resemble a large pond, complete with black-legged white herons feeding in it. This vivid hyperbole captures the depth of her sorrow and the desolation of her separation, characteristic of the Neytal (coastal) landscape where themes of pining and waiting are prominent.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.73],[0.73,1.1],[1.1,1.9],[1.9,2.87],[2.87,3.22],[3.25,3.26],[3.26,4.1],[4.1,6.08],[6.08,6.2],[6.2,6.2],[6.2,6.2],[6.2,6.86],[6.86,7.4],[7.4,7.5],[7.5,8.4],[8.4,9.5],[9.5,9.7],[9.7,10.1],[10.1,11.5],[11.5,11.5],[11.5,12.6],[12.6,13.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.83],[0.83,1.3],[1.3,2.3],[2.3,2.3],[2.3,2.75],[2.9,3.5],[3.5,4.4],[4.4,5.4],[5.4,5.67],[5.67,5.9],[5.9,5.9],[5.9,6.98],[6.98,7.7],[7.7,7.9],[7.9,8.8],[8.8,10.0],[10.0,10.1],[10.1,10.7],[11.6,12.2],[12.2,12.63],[12.7,13.2],[13.2,13.7]]},"sync":[[["சேறு